			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Documentation sync and domain migration\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to 1dc54aff, incorporating Air's README restructuring with architecture principles and responsibility matrix, Common/Echo/Mist/Rest/SideCar synchronization of the Documentation/Rust submodule pointer, and Maintain's Content-Security-Policy frame-ancestors correction to land.playform.cloud.\n\nAll changes are documentation synchronization and domain configuration alignment with no functional behavior changes.",
