			"Message": "chore(Land): Exclude generated code directories from Rust formatter\n\nAdd Generated, .generated, and gen to the Maintain/Format/Rust.py exclusion set, and include Element/Vine/Source/Generated in rustfmt.toml ignore list.\n\nGenerated code in these directories will no longer be reformatted by tooling, reducing noise in code review and avoiding conflicts with regenerated artifacts.",
