			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule and restore badge URLs\n\nAdvance the Element submodule from 16b5c401 to 7d3a928, incorporating Air's migration of default update server URL and DNS wildcard references from land.playform.cloud to editor.land, Grove's cleanup of stale Documentation/Rust artifacts, Mountain's whitespace normalization in prost-generated Vine protobuf Rust output, and Rest's Content-Security-Policy frame-ancestors alignment with land.playform.cloud.\n\nRestore color-coded query parameters (?label=, ?color=, ?labelColor=, ?logoColor=, ?logoWidth=, ?style=flat, ?logo=github) across all repository status shields in README.md.",
			"SHA": "961ae4e89ed1451d9e36ef83153f8fbee1440736"
